<statement>
<p>What are the solutions to <m>\displaystyle-{7}{\left({x}+{3}\right)}^{{2}}+{21}={0}</m>? <fillin characters="12"/></p>
<p>Round solutions to two decimal places.</p>

</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>-1.27,-4.73</li></ul></p>
</answer>
<solution><p><m>\displaystyle-{7}{\left({x}+{3}\right)}^{{2}}+{21}={0}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle-{7}{\left({x}+{3}\right)}^{{2}}=-{21}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{\left({x}+{3}\right)}^{{2}}={3}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}+{3}=\pm{1.7320508075689}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}=-{3}\pm{1.7320508075689}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}=-{1.2679491924311},-{4.7320508075689}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}=-{1.27},-{4.73}</m></p></solution>
</myopenmath>